# Imperial units, from the UK Weights and Measures Act 1985, schedule 1, and NIST SP 811 (2008), appendix B.
# Gallon 4.54609 L; stone and long ton in avoirdupois pounds. All other units come from us-customary.units.
# Format: symbol:name formula [Type]; '#' starts a comment.

@system Imperial
@extends us-customary.units
@include si.units

st:stone 14 lb
ton_UK:ton_UK 2240 lb
gal_UK:gallon_UK 4.54609 L
qt_UK:quart_UK 1|4 gal_UK
pt_UK:pint_UK 1|8 gal_UK
gi_UK:gill_UK 1|32 gal_UK
floz_UK:fluid_ounce_UK 1|160 gal_UK

@preferred Volume gal_UK
